My husband can teach some Pokémon the
ultimate moves! I'll tell you their names.{VAR BE01}
The blazing Fire-type Pokémon:
Charizard, Typhlosion, Blaziken,{VAR BE00}
Infernape, and Emboar!{VAR BE01}
The restless Water-type Pokémon:
Blastoise, Feraligatr, Swampert,{VAR BE00}
Empoleon, and Samurott!{VAR BE01}
The quiet Grass-type Pokémon: Venusaur,
Meganium, Sceptile, Torterra,{VAR BE00}
and Serperior!
